@startuml 5g-ip-private
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title 5G IP после UPF: детальная схема сервисных классов

rectangle "UPF QoS enforcement" as UPF {
  queue "VoNR / IMS\n5QI 1/5 -> EF/CS" as IMSQ
  queue "Enterprise slice\nS-NSSAI + DNN\nGFBR / SLA" as ENTQ
  queue "eMBB internet\n5QI 9 best effort" as EMBQ
  queue "Low-latency MEC\ncustom 5QI" as MECQ
}
rectangle "N6 service chain" as CHAIN {
  rectangle "QER policer/shaper\nper QoS Flow" as QER
  rectangle "DSCP marking\nQoS trust boundary" as DSCP
  rectangle "Firewall/DPI\napplication policy" as DPI
}
rectangle "Transport/IP QoS" as IPQ {
  queue "LLQ\nvoice/low latency" as LLQ
  queue "AF queue\nenterprise/premium" as AF
  queue "BE queue\nmass internet" as BE
}
cloud "IMS core" as IMS
cloud "Enterprise DC" as DC
cloud "MEC app" as MEC
cloud "Internet/CDN" as NET

IMSQ --> QER
ENTQ --> QER
MECQ --> QER
QER --> DSCP
DSCP --> LLQ
DSCP --> AF
LLQ --> IMS
LLQ --> MEC
AF --> DC
EMBQ --> DPI
DPI --> BE
BE --> NET

note bottom
Для качества группы пользователей в 5G обычно совмещают:
S-NSSAI, DNN, PCF policy, SMF UPF selection,
QER shaping, DSCP/IP QoS и MEC/local breakout.
end note
@enduml
